<title>USA: Public Service Enterprise Group Inc Q4 net.</title>
<headline>Public Service Enterprise Group Inc Q4 net.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, N.J. 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.54		    $0.62</p>
<p> Net			127,121		  152,283</p>
<p> Revs		   1,574,078		1,556,612</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 237,143		  244,698</p>
<p>		     Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $2.52		    $2.71</p>
<p> Net			611,596		  662,323</p>
<p> Revs		   6,041,172	     5,8933,662</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 242,401		  244,698</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Net includes profits from discontinued operations of nil vs $36.9 million, or $0.15/shr, in Q4, and $10.7 million, or $0.04/shr, vs $35.0 million, or $0.14/shr, in year.</p>
<p>1996 year net includes gain of $13.5 million, or $0.06/shr, on disposition of assets.</p>
<p>1995 year net includes after-tax gains from allowance for funds used during construction of $726,000 in qtr and $5.3 million in year, and other income of $1.4 million in qtr, $8.0 million in year.</p>
<p>1996 other income was loss $2.5 million in qtr and loss $1.9 million in year.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
